":"original","quote":"长沙太守张羡叛表，﹝四﹞表围之连年不下。羡病死，长沙复立其子怿。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":452,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":85,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o083a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-9401ecfd7822232cd717","layer":"original","quote":"表遂攻并怿。南收零、桂〖9〗，北据汉川〖10〗，地方数千里，带甲十余万。﹝五﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":453,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o082","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-322bf0e13e883f10a9d2","layer":"original","quote":"张济引兵入荆州界，攻穰城，为流矢所中死，荆州官属皆贺。表曰：“济以穷来〖6〗。主人无礼，至于交锋，此非牧意〖7〗；牧受吊〖8〗，不受贺也。”使人纳其众；众闻之喜，遂服从。长沙太守张羡叛表，﹝四﹞表围之连年不下。羡病死，长沙复立其子怿。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":452,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":117,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o083","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-9401ecfd7822232cd717","layer":"original","quote":"表遂攻并怿。南收零、桂〖9〗，北据汉川〖10〗，地方数千里，带甲十余万。﹝五﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":453,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-890da84a962d13230aca","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-463d65be72c8a9d2f71d","layer":"original","quote":"阶说其太守张羡曰〖7〗：“夫举事而不本于义，未有不败者也。故齐桓率诸侯以尊周〖8〗，晋文逐叔带以纳王〖9〗。今袁氏反此；而刘牧应之〖10〗，取祸之道也。明府必欲立功明义〖11〗，全福远祸，不宜与之同也。”羡曰：“然则何向而可？”阶曰：“曹公虽弱，仗义而起；救朝廷之危，奉王命而讨有罪：孰敢不服？今若举四郡保三江〖12〗，以待其来而为之内应，不亦可乎！”羡曰：“善。”乃举长沙及旁三郡以拒表，遣使诣太祖。太祖大悦","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":227,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
